OL,3,GNEWSAThunderstorm warnings remain for
OL,4,Aparts of UK but drought continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FMet Office yellow warnings will stay in
OL,7,Fforce throughout Thursday and the early
OL,8,Fhours of Friday as downpours and
OL,9,Fthunderstorms continue.
OL,11,FA broad swathe of England and Wales is
OL,12,Fcovered by a thunderstorm warning which
OL,13,Fis valid until 22:00 BST.
OL,15,FHeavy rain will continue to bring the
OL,16,Frisk of flash flooding and travel
OL,17,Fdisruption, with up to 75mm (3in) of
OL,18,Frain possible in places - accompanied
OL,19,Fby large hail, lightning and gusty
OL,20,Fwinds.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
