OL,3,GNEWSAThunderstorm warnings remain for
OL,4,Aparts of UK but drought continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Midlands has been one of the worst
OL,7,Faffected areas so far with "significant
OL,8,Fflooding" in areas including Birmingham
OL,9,Fand Staffordshire.
